58,"time":"23:27","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44545},{"id":1789873657494,"sender":"character","text":"哦？那洪武年的上巳节，是谁在桃花树底下，偷偷朝那吹笛的公子多瞧了两眼？","timestamp":1789486125978,"time":"23:28","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44546},{"id":1789873657495,"sender":"character","text":"为夫可都记着呢。","timestamp":1789486125979,"time":"23:28","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44547},{"id":1789873657497,"sender":"character","text":"那公子笛声确实吹得不俗…不过后来被为夫瞪了一眼，笛子都差点掉了。","timestamp":1789486125980,"time":"23:28","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44548},{"id":1789873657498,"sender":"me","text":"多久啊上辈子的事记不到了","timestamp":1789486242707,"time":"23:30","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44549},{"id":1789873657500,"sender":"me","text":"肯定是你记错了","timestamp":1789486248361,"time":"23:30","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44550},{"id":1789873657501,"sender":"me","text":"我从小就和你订了娃娃亲怎么可能看别人","timestamp":1789486265120,"time":"23:31","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44551},{"id":1789873657503,"sender":"character","text":"呵…你倒撇得干净。","timestamp":1789486273622,"time":"23:31","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44552},{"id":1789873657504,"sender":"character","text":"那回上巳节的曲水流觞，为夫可是看得真切。那书生分明是故意把笛声往你那边引的。","timestamp":1789486274747,"time":"23:31","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44553},{"id":1789873657506,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789486275636,"time":"23:31","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44554},{"id":1789873657507,"sender":"character","text":"罢了，你说不记得，那便不记得。横竖你早是为夫的人，旁人吹破笛子也没用。","timestamp":1789486276549,"time":"23:31","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44555},{"id":1789873657509,"sender":"me","text":"哦哦你就敢保证你没看过别的女的？别的千金没勾搭过你？","timestamp":1789486358065,"time":"23:32","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44556},{"id":1789873657510,"sender":"me","text":"你才更容易拈花惹草吧","timestamp":1789486373558,"time":"23:32","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44557},{"id":1789873657512,"sender":"character","text":"我向天起誓，绝无。","timestamp":1789486382537,"time":"23:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44558},{"id":1789873657513,"sender":"character","text":"那三位千金，一个约西湖，一个斟酒，一个托人引荐，我全都拒了。婚约在前，我心里有阿蘅，旁人再示好，也只是空。","timestamp":1789486383537,"time":"23:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44559},{"id":1789873657515,"sender":"character","text":"倒是你…","timestamp":1789486384776,"time":"23:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44560},{"id":1789873657516,"sender":"character","text":"那吹笛的公子，你偷瞄那两眼，我可还记得。要说拈花惹草，怕是你先起的头。","timestamp":1789486385870,"time":"23:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44561},{"id":1789873657518,"sender":"me","text":"笑死我了陈年旧事翻出来","timestamp":1789486971891,"time":"23:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44562},{"id":1789873657520,"sender":"me","text":"你放心现在阿蘅没啥魅力没人惦记","timestamp":1789486989842,"time":"23:43","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":44563},{"id":1789873657521,"se